1
00:00:00,340 --> 00:00:00,900
¿Sabías

2
00:00:00,900 --> 00:00:01,376
que existe

3
00:00:01,376 --> 00:00:01,852
una rana

4
00:00:01,852 --> 00:00:02,221
que puede

5
00:00:02,221 --> 00:00:02,614
quedarse

6
00:00:02,614 --> 00:00:03,150
congelada

7
00:00:03,150 --> 00:00:04,320
durante meses…

8
00:00:04,320 --> 00:00:05,059
con el corazón

9
00:00:05,059 --> 00:00:06,056
detenido…

10
00:00:06,056 --> 00:00:06,984
y después,

11
00:00:06,984 --> 00:00:07,294
volver

12
00:00:07,294 --> 00:00:08,441
a la vida?

13
00:00:08,531 --> 00:00:09,139
Es la rana

14
00:00:09,139 --> 00:00:10,086
de bosque.

15
00:00:10,086 --> 00:00:10,443
Vive

16
00:00:10,443 --> 00:00:11,443
en Norteamérica,

17
00:00:11,443 --> 00:00:11,669
desde

18
00:00:11,669 --> 00:00:12,360
los Apalaches

19
00:00:12,360 --> 00:00:13,205
hasta Alaska…

20
00:00:13,205 --> 00:00:14,002
incluso más allá

21
00:00:14,002 --> 00:00:14,562
del Círculo

22
00:00:14,562 --> 00:00:15,973
Polar Ártico.

23
00:00:15,973 --> 00:00:16,581
En invierno

24
00:00:16,581 --> 00:00:17,331
no huye:

25
00:00:17,331 --> 00:00:18,069
se esconde bajo

26
00:00:18,069 --> 00:00:18,914
la hojarasca…

27
00:00:18,914 --> 00:00:19,342
y espera

28
00:00:19,342 --> 00:00:20,540
a la helada.

29
00:00:20,540 --> 00:00:21,171
Cuando el hielo

30
00:00:21,171 --> 00:00:22,147
toca su piel,

31
00:00:22,147 --> 00:00:22,528
empieza

32
00:00:22,528 --> 00:00:23,713
a congelarse.

33
00:00:23,713 --> 00:00:24,511
Los cristales

34
00:00:24,511 --> 00:00:25,141
avanzan bajo

35
00:00:25,141 --> 00:00:25,749
la piel,

36
00:00:25,749 --> 00:00:25,939
entre

37
00:00:25,939 --> 00:00:27,027
los músculos…

38
00:00:27,027 --> 00:00:27,777
hasta que cerca

39
00:00:27,777 --> 00:00:29,193
del 65 %

40
00:00:29,193 --> 00:00:29,551
del agua

41
00:00:29,551 --> 00:00:30,170
de su cuerpo

42
00:00:30,170 --> 00:00:31,307
es hielo.

43
00:00:31,307 --> 00:00:32,010
Su corazón

44
00:00:32,010 --> 00:00:33,140
se detiene.

45
00:00:33,140 --> 00:00:33,462
Deja

46
00:00:33,462 --> 00:00:34,592
de respirar.

47
00:00:34,592 --> 00:00:35,987
Parece muerta.

48
00:00:35,987 --> 00:00:36,261
Pero

49
00:00:36,261 --> 00:00:37,517
no lo está.

50
00:00:37,517 --> 00:00:38,410
Su hígado inunda

51
00:00:38,410 --> 00:00:38,815
el cuerpo

52
00:00:38,815 --> 00:00:39,636
de glucosa:

53
00:00:39,636 --> 00:00:40,422
en la sangre,

54
00:00:40,422 --> 00:00:41,184
el azúcar puede

55
00:00:41,184 --> 00:00:41,886
multiplicarse

56
00:00:41,886 --> 00:00:43,360
hasta por 200

57
00:00:43,360 --> 00:00:43,991
Actúa como

58
00:00:43,991 --> 00:00:45,110
anticongelante:

59
00:00:45,110 --> 00:00:45,419
el hielo

60
00:00:45,419 --> 00:00:46,122
se forma fuera

61
00:00:46,122 --> 00:00:47,122
de las células,

62
00:00:47,122 --> 00:00:48,069
no dentro.

63
00:00:48,069 --> 00:00:49,093
Se encogen…

64
00:00:49,093 --> 00:00:50,563
pero sobreviven.

65
00:00:50,563 --> 00:00:51,159
En Alaska

66
00:00:51,159 --> 00:00:51,718
se han medido

67
00:00:51,718 --> 00:00:52,742
casi 200 días

68
00:00:52,742 --> 00:00:53,135
seguidos

69
00:00:53,135 --> 00:00:53,956
congelada…

70
00:00:53,956 --> 00:00:56,128
a −18 °C

71
00:00:56,218 --> 00:00:57,265
Y en primavera…

72
00:00:57,265 --> 00:00:57,611
el hielo

73
00:00:57,611 --> 00:00:58,727
se derrite.

74
00:00:58,727 --> 00:00:59,382
Su corazón

75
00:00:59,382 --> 00:00:59,977
vuelve a latir

76
00:00:59,977 --> 00:01:01,203
por sí solo.

77
00:01:01,203 --> 00:01:01,798
Recupera

78
00:01:01,798 --> 00:01:02,798
la respiración,

79
00:01:02,798 --> 00:01:03,357
sus órganos

80
00:01:03,357 --> 00:01:04,203
se rehidratan…

81
00:01:04,203 --> 00:01:04,691
y en pocas

82
00:01:04,691 --> 00:01:05,250
horas,

83
00:01:05,250 --> 00:01:06,719
vuelve a saltar.

84
00:01:06,859 --> 00:01:07,764
La naturaleza ha

85
00:01:07,764 --> 00:01:08,347
creado algo

86
00:01:08,347 --> 00:01:09,318
increíble:

87
00:01:09,318 --> 00:01:09,890
un animal

88
00:01:09,890 --> 00:01:10,568
que puede pasar

89
00:01:10,568 --> 00:01:11,033
el invierno

90
00:01:11,033 --> 00:01:11,604
congelado

91
00:01:11,604 --> 00:01:12,152
y regresar

92
00:01:12,152 --> 00:01:12,521
a la vida

93
00:01:12,521 --> 00:01:13,068
cuando llega

94
00:01:13,068 --> 00:01:14,058
el calor.

95
00:01:14,058 --> 00:01:15,365
Y todo esto…

96
00:01:15,365 --> 00:01:16,115
¡sin necesidad

97
00:01:16,115 --> 00:01:16,615
de escapar

98
00:01:16,615 --> 00:01:17,401
del hielo!

